OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket freezers in Belgium
OL,4,Aand Sweden hit by suspected
OL,5,Acyber-attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of supermarkets in Belgium and
OL,8,FSweden have been hit by a suspected
OL,9,Fcyber-attack affecting its
OL,10,Frefrigerators and freezers.
OL,12,FAround 40 Delhaize supermarkets and 15
OL,13,FCarrefour stores were affected in
OL,14,FBelgium, while several ICA and Coop
OL,15,Fshops in Sweden were hit. Thirteen
OL,16,FSuperValu shops have also been impacted
OL,17,Fin Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
